@DistributedWorkflow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268
@OperationId = replace-with-operation-id-from-post-response

### Register a document
POST {{DistributedWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/registrations
Idempotency-Key: registration-example-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "documentId": "document-123",
  "title": "Example document"
}

### Get the current registration status
# Copy operationId from the POST response into the OperationId variable above.
GET {{DistributedWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/registrations/{{OperationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Liveness check
GET {{DistributedWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness check
GET {{DistributedWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

###
